// Copy to Local.xcconfig (git-ignored). Antresol.xcconfig includes it for every target, so
// each value here overrides the default in project.yml, for Debug and Release.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM: your team id (developer.apple.com > Membership details). Empty: the
// simulator signs to run locally; device builds and archives need a team.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
//
// The app's bundle id. It defaults to app.antresol.tv; register your own, and the rest
// follows: the Top Shelf extension is <id>.topshelf, the UI tests <id>.uitests, the App
// Group group.<id> and the shared Keychain group <team prefix><id>.shared.
// ANTRESOL_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.antresol
//
// Override the groups only to reuse ones you already registered:
// ANTRESOL_APP_GROUP = group.com.example.shared
// ANTRESOL_KEYCHAIN_GROUP = com.example.shared
